 "summary": "Adds scripts/corpus_render_report.py, which renders every pinned corpus file in full and records the error category and source offset for each failure. 26 focused tests pass; ./dev verify reports CTest 80/80 and Python 328/328; ASan and UBSan each pass 80/80. The committed report accounts for all 58 manifest files: 39 render-tested (1 renders, 26 limit, 8 unsupported, 4 xml) and 19 skipped above the 32 MiB threshold. Two runs produced byte-identical JSON (sha256 2f780b2b\u2026ec5f, recorded in determinism.json). Key finding: the full-render path is hard-capped at 16 MiB by SHAPE_MAX_BYTES, and 11 files fail at exactly offset 16777216. No renderer, parser, raster, policy or platform code changed."
